OL,3,GNEWSAFire that killed mum and three
OL,4,Achildren caused by e-scooter battery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house fire that killed a mother and
OL,7,Fthree of her children was caused by an
OL,8,Fe-scooter lithium-ion battery which was
OL,9,Fon charge at the time, the fire service
OL,10,Fhas confirmed.
OL,12,FElisha Brabin, 36, and her children,
OL,13,FLeo, 16, Ellis, eight, and Prudence,
OL,14,Fseven, died after the blaze "spread
OL,15,Frapidly" inside their home on Stone
OL,16,FSquare in Bootle, Merseyside, in the
OL,17,Fearly hours of last Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
