OL,3,GNEWSAFire that killed mum and three
OL,4,Achildren caused by e-scooter battery
OL,5,
OL,6,FMerseyside Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Finitially said only that the fire was
OL,8,Fcaused by an "electrical event" linked
OL,9,Fto a lithium-ion battery but has now
OL,10,Fprovided the new detail.
OL,12,FHead of fire prevention Kev Johnson
OL,13,Fsaid the fire "highlights the very real
OL,14,Frisks posed by lithium-ion batteries".
